cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use HDLFACTORY, please cite this work."
title: "HDLFACTORY: A Lightweight Open-Source Multi-Agent Framework for Verilog Generation, Optimization, and Validation Using Large Language Models"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-08-28
abstract: >-
  HDLFACTORY is an end-to-end framework for generating synthesizable Verilog
  from natural-language specifications, optimizing designs for area and power,
  and validating them with Verilator and Icarus Verilog.
authors:
